{
  "$comment": "DDD bridge for Material Design 3 (baseline scheme) from the Sass token files @material/web ships. Tiers follow elements/d-d-d/design-system/bridge/contract.json. Named DDD colors map onto the M3 reference palettes (mode-free); the theme chrome uses the sys color roles, light and dark. M3's baseline primary is purple, so brand roles are purple; incorrect stays on the purple static palette and correct on green, which with HAX's labels, icons and line styles keeps the meaning channels. Kept as DDD on purpose: light and black font weights (Roboto ships 400/500/700 as M3 tokens), control heights, border widths, and heading/body sizes.",
